  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Since 4 is one of the root of $x^2+p x+12=0 \\Rightarrow 16+4 p+12=0 \\Rightarrow p=-7$ and equation $x^2+p x+q=0$ has equal roots\n$$\n\\Rightarrow D=49-4 q=0 \\Rightarrow q=\\frac{49}{4}\n$$",
